218
00:11:39,190 --> 00:11:42,530
Well, maybe the next batch, we could all get some.

219
00:11:42,740 --> 00:11:45,070
Oh, God, this is fun, isn't it?

220
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:47,530
You know, just the four of us.

221
00:11:47,700 --> 00:11:49,870
Just hanging. Ha.

222
00:11:50,040 --> 00:11:51,660
Dude, are you okay?

223
00:11:51,830 --> 00:11:53,750
